Accountants has not complied with Section la3(3)(e) of the Companies Act, 2013 and theliable for penalty under Section 450 of the companies Act,2013.
Accordingly, I am inclined to impose a penalty as prescribed under Section 450 of theCompanies Act, 2013. The details of the penalty imposed on the company and officers indefault are shown in the table below:
Therefore, in view of the above said violation, in o<ercise of tJre powers vested to theundersigned under section 454(r) & (3) of the companies Act, 2013 a penarry ofRs'10,000/- (Rupees Ten thousand) is imposed on the Auditor for each Fys i.e.2014-15 &2016-17. Totally Rs.20,000/- (Rupee Twenq, thousand) is imposed on the Auditor forviolation of section 143 of the companies Act, 2013 for the Fy 2014-15 &2016-17.
8' The said amount of penalty shall be paid through online by using the websitewww'mca'gov'in(Misc. head) within 90 days of receipt of this order, and intimate thisoffice with proof of penalry paid.
